Nova is a modified fork of OpenJarvis (https://github.com/open-jarvis/OpenJarvis),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The original copyright and license
terms are preserved in the LICENSE file.

Changes made to the original work include: renaming the project to Nova, removing
unused messaging channels, the Rust extension, analytics, mining and auto-update
components, and rewriting the affected components in Python.

